<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Think how the Savior</l><l>Came from above</l><l>Suffered on Calvary,</l><l>Breathing out love;</l><l>Think how He loves us,</l><l>E’en when we stray:</l><l>We must love others,</l><l>Love is His way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>See, they are waiting,</l><l>Looking at you,</l><l>Silently watching</l><l>All that you do;</l><l>Seeming so careless,</l><l>Hardened and lost:</l><l>“Love never faileth,”</l><l>Count not the cost.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Love never faileth,”</l><l>Love is pure gold:</l><l>Love is what Jesus</l><l>Came to unfold;</l><l>Love these souls thru us,</l><l>Savior, we pray;</l><l>Thy love ne’er faileth,</l><l>Love is Thy way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
